---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
import { PROPERTY_ASSISTANT as P } from "../data/products";
import { SELLER as S, POLICY_LINKS as L } from "../data/seller";
---

<LegalPage
  title="Refund and cancellation policy"
  description={`How to cancel a ${P.name} subscription, when a payment is refunded and how to ask. Sold by ${S.legalName}.`}
>
  <h1>Refund and cancellation policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p>

  <p class="note">
    This policy covers the Assistant plan of <a href={`/${P.slug}/`}>{P.name}</a> (USD 99 a month for each
    office), sold by <strong>{S.legalName}</strong> under the {S.brand} brand. The full conditions are in the
    <a href={L.subscriptionTerms}>subscription and trial terms</a>. Credits for the online tools (SEO Desk,
    Content Engine) follow their own <a href={L.toolsTerms}>terms of service</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>The free trial</h2>
  <p>
    The 14-day trial is free and we do not ask for a payment card. It stops by itself. There is nothing to
    cancel and nothing to refund.
  </p>

  <h2>How to cancel a subscription</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>E-mail <a href={`mailto:${S.supportEmail}`}>{S.supportEmail}</a> from an address at your office and say
      that you want to cancel.</li>
    <li>We confirm by e-mail within 24 hours on working days. The cancellation counts from the moment your e-mail
      arrived, not from our reply.</li>
    <li>No further payment is taken. Your assistant keeps working until the end of the month you have already
      paid for.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    You can cancel at any time. There is no minimum term, no notice period and no cancellation fee.
  </p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>
    You can try the service free for 14 days before you pay, so a month that has started is not refunded,
    in full or in part. When you cancel, you keep the service to the end of the paid month.
  </p>
  <p>We refund a payment in full when:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>you were charged twice for the same month;</li>
    <li>you were charged after we received your cancellation;</li>
    <li>we did not deliver your assistant within 10 working days of your first payment.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If we end your subscription or stop offering the service, we refund the part of your last payment that
    covers the time after the service stops.
  </p>

  <h2>How to ask for a refund</h2>
  <p>
    E-mail <a href={`mailto:${S.supportEmail}`}>{S.supportEmail}</a> with your office's name and the date of the
    payment. We answer within 24 hours on working days. An approved refund goes back to the card that was charged; your
    bank usually shows it within 5 to 10 working days.
  </p>

  <h2>A payment you do not recognise</h2>
  <p>
    The payment appears on your card statement as
    the name of our company, BioInsight Lab Inc., or our brand, LeadFlow. If you see a
    payment from us that you do not recognise, write to us first. We reply within 24 hours on working days and can
    usually settle it faster than a dispute through your bank.
  </p>

  <h2>Delivery</h2>
  <p>
    The service is digital. Nothing is shipped and there is nothing to return. We deliver by e-mail to the
    work address you gave us; the details are in section 11 of the
    <a href={L.subscriptionTerms}>subscription and trial terms</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Other packages</h2>
  <p>
    The Marketing and Lead Desk packages, the voice agent add-on and CRM (customer relationship management
    system) integration are sold by written quote, not by card on this website. Their payment and cancellation
    terms are set in that quote. The voice agent add-on is sold with a 12-month contract.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {S.legalName}, {S.address}. Customer service: <a href={`mailto:${S.supportEmail}`}>{S.supportEmail}</a>.
    More on the <a href={L.contact}>contact page</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
